+    // Both calls land in NVKMS through nvkms_ioctl_from_kapi(): while the GPU is suspended that
+    // waits on the PM gate for up to 30 s, and once NVKMS is LOST the FREE_DEVICE request is
+    // refused while FreeDevice() still frees the RM side - the KMS half would be left behind and
